      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-812-5499" style="padding-inline-start: 2em; text-indent: -2em">
        <p><seg source="#source-880-889">第一　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-889-913"><rb>毎日</rb><rt>まいにち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-913-916">六</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-916-931"><rb>時</rb><rt>じ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-931-934">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-934-946"><rb>起</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-946-952">き、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-952-973"><rb>寢衣</rb><rt>ねまき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-973-976">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-976-994"><rb>着替</rb><rt>きか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-994-1000">へ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1000-1021"><rb>蒲團</rb><rt>ふとん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1021-1024">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1024-1039"><rb>塵</rb><rt>ちり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1039-1042">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1042-1057"><rb>拂</rb><rt>はら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1057-1063">ひ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1063-1081"><rb>寢間</rb><rt>ねま</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1081-1105"><rb>其外</rb><rt>そのほか</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1105-1123"><rb>居間</rb><rt>ゐま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1123-1126">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1126-1147"><rb>掃除</rb><rt>さうじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1147-1153">し、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1153-1177"><rb>身體</rb><rt>しんたい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1177-1180">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1180-1204"><rb>十分</rb><rt>じふぶん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1204-1225"><rb>安靜</rb><rt>しづか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1225-1237">にして、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1237-1261"><rb>朝飯</rb><rt>あさはん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1261-1264