        <p><seg source="#source-1308-1317">第二　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1317-1341"><rb>毎日</rb><rt>まいにち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1341-1344">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1344-1368"><rb>食餌</rb><rt>しよくじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1368-1371">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1371-1392"><rb>三度</rb><rt>さんど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1392-1395">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1395-1410"><rb>限</rb><rt>かぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1410-1416">り、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1416-1443"><rb>分量</rb><rt>ぶんりやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1443-1446">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1446-1461"><rb>定</rb><rt>さだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1461-1464">む</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1464-1476"><rb>可</rb><rt>べ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1476-1482">し。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1482-1506"><rb>夜中</rb><rt>やちゆう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1506-1509">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1509-1536"><rb>飮食</rb><rt>いんしよく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1536-1548">せざるを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1548-1566"><rb>最</rb><rt>もつと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1566-1584">もよしとす。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1584-1602"><rb>但</rb><rt>たゞし</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1602-1626"><rb>食後</rb><rt>しよくご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1626-1629">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1629-1656"><rb>少時間</rb><rt>しばらく</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1656-1680"><rb>休息</rb><rt>きうそく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1680-1683">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1683-1707"><rb>運動</rb><rt>うんどう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1707-1710">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#sour