        <p><seg source="#source-2915-2924">第六　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2924-2948"><rb>毎日</rb><rt>まいにち</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2948-2969"><rb>一度</rb><rt>いちど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2969-2972">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2972-2996"><rb>冷水</rb><rt>ひやみづ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2996-3014"><rb>或</rb><rt>あるひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3014-3017">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3017-3041"><rb>微温湯</rb><rt>ぬるゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3041-3047">にて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3047-3068"><rb>身體</rb><rt>からだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3068-3071">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3071-3092"><rb>清潔</rb><rt>きれい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3092-3095">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3095-3110"><rb>拭</rb><rt>ぬぐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3110-3122">ひとり、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3122-3143"><rb>肌着</rb><rt>はだぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3143-3146">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3146-3167"><rb>着替</rb><rt>きかへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3167-3176">べし。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3176-3194"><rb>入浴</rb><rt>ふろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3194-3203">は六七</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3203-3227"><rb>日目</rb><rt>にちめ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3227-3242"><rb>毎</rb><rt>ごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3242-3245">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3245-3260"><rb>成</rb><rt>なる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3260-3266">たけ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3266-3281"><rb>熱</rb><rt>あつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-3281-3293">からざる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-3293-3305"><rb>湯</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg s